{
  "title": "Quick Nutty Vietnamese Pita Bread Bun Rieu",
  "description": "A nutty and bouncy Vietnamese dish featuring pita bread, perfect for a sick day, with an al-dente finish and halal-friendly ingredients, served in a bun-rieu form.",
